 "review": {
  "management_type_reason": "RHS・MBG・おぎはら・品種: 花後に刈り込むと返り咲く。NC State・品種: 不稔でこぼれ種なし、花壇を占領しない。MBG・品種の「こぼれ種で攻撃的に殖えることがある」は NC State と食い違い、こぼれ種なので E にしない（MBG が品種ページなので中）。NC State の「夏半ばに切ると返り咲く」は花後の切り戻し",
  "management_type_quote": "Trim after flowering to keep plants compact and to encourage a second flowering",
  "management_type_by_matching": "B 花後刈込型",
  "heat_west_only": "弱",
  "muggy_west_only": "弱",
  "heat_muggy_west_evidence": "[おぎはら/品種] 耐暑性；強\n[おぎはら 強・欧米 弱] おぎはら自身も楽天のページで蒸れ・暖地の日かげの注意を書いているので、中 にした\n[おぎはら楽天/品種] 耐湿性: やや弱い 高温多湿を嫌います（蒸れ 弱 相当）\n[MBG/品種] Somewhat intolerant of the heat and humidity of the deep South, however, and appreciates some light afternoon shade in hot summer climates such as the St.\n[NC State/品種] If planted in the south, it may do better with some afternoon shade and may be bothered by humidity.\n[食い違い] 欧米の文献（品種の記述）は 弱 相当。おぎはら植物園の値を採った\n[RHS/品種] Aspect: South-facing or West-facing or East-facing",
  "spread_evidence": "[こぼれ種 0／NC State・品種] sterile with no seed production（読み直し）\n[こぼれ種 0／NC State・品種] They are sterile with no seed production and will rebloom if cut back mid-summer.\n[こぼれ種の食い違い] MBG は 3 相当",
